{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"qg9_lis_fdj","canonical_person_id":"qg9_lis_fdj","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["qg9_lis_fdj"],"persons":[{"id":"cwx_3y8_7ha_A","label":"華諝（華融子，吳黃門郎）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"諝","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p002:m0118","c-jinshu-052-huatan-wu064-ancestry:p001:m0026"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p002:m0118","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p002","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete","quote":"諝"},{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-052-huatan-wu064-ancestry:p001:m0026","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-052-huatan-wu064-ancestry:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-052-huatan-wu064-ancestry","quote":"諝"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"華諝（華融子，吳黃門郎），見本組原文及身份互校。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"cwx_3y8_7ha","source_assertion_id":"a-wu064-xu-rong-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-064","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete-ws2263487","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p002","quote":"文士傳曰：華融字德蕤，廣陵江都人。祖父避亂，居山陰蕊山下。時皇象亦寓居山陰，吳郡張溫來就像學，欲得所舍。或告溫曰：「蕊山下有華德蕤者，雖年少，美有令志，可舍也。」溫遂止融家，朝夕談講。俄而溫為選部尚書，乃擢融為太子庶子，遂知名顯達。融子諝，黃門郎，與融並見害。次子譚，以才辯稱，晉秘書監。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p002:m0118","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p002:m0005","source_term":"融子諝"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"按同段具名父子及親稱次第。"}},{"id":"qg9_lis_fdj","label":"華譚","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"華譚","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p022:m0110","c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p024:m0002","c-jinshu-052-huatan-wu064-ancestry:p001:m0000"]},{"surface":"譚","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-061-zho